59
00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:41.400
From the Deep Learning team,
we have Geoff Ladwig and Esmael

60
00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.420
Gargari.

61
00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:44.600
The first lesson starts
with an overview of Rack.

62
00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.280
I hope you go on
to watch that right after this.

63
00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:52.100
And with these techniques,
it turns out it's possible for smaller

64
00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.640
